#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Exact-head executor for FFBK PR #1412's frozen WiscPropFund temporal protocol.

Protocol authority (read-only): pokekarten/FFBK PR #1412 exact reviewed head
824a9f3ca63e95efbae92839a30cacf213db8840

This file is intentionally a successor to the already-executed v0 script.  It does
not rewrite that historical artifact.
"""
